{"surah":114,"ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"arabicText":"قُلْ اَعُوْذُ بِرَبِّ النَّاسِۙ","translation":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind,"},{"numberInSurah":2,"arabicText":"مَلِكِ النَّاسِۙ","translation":"The Sovereign of mankind."},{"numberInSurah":3,"arabicText":"اِلٰهِ النَّاسِۙ","translation":"The God of mankind,"},{"numberInSurah":4,"arabicText":"مِنْ شَرِّ الْوَسْوَاسِ١ۙ۬ الْخَنَّاسِ۪ۙ","translation":"From the evil of the retreating whisperer -"},{"numberInSurah":5,"arabicText":"الَّذِیْ یُوَسْوِسُ فِیْ صُدُوْرِ النَّاسِۙ","translation":"Who whispers [evil] into the breasts of mankind -"},{"numberInSurah":6,"arabicText":"مِنَ الْجِنَّةِ وَ النَّاسِ۠ ۧ","translation":"From among the jinn and mankind.\""}]}